Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:15.72,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Boy you’re playing with fire
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.35,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}負ける気しないわ
