Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.33,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}So I’m giving you my attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.46,0:01:44.50,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:46.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}とめられない You can’t kill my vibe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:47.67,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}自由に I can blow your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:49.51,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}何度だって You’ll see me rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:50.97,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Tryna get to me and pay the price
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.97,0:01:54.01,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}描いた未来へ　進んで行くだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:56.80,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Won’t look back
