Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.57,0:22:24.70,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Ah, まとまんない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:25.66,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}待って、まとまんない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:26.37,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}当たり前じゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.37,0:22:27.37,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}それ、当たり前じゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.37,0:22:29.04,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}明日から中学生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.04,0:22:30.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}頭ん中パンクしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.75,0:22:32.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}No, it cannot be true
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.75,0:22:34.21,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}バグった将来のビジョン
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.21,0:22:35.75,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Oh no, oh no, oh no
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:37.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}明日から Restart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:38.42,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Ride, ride or die
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.42,0:22:39.50,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}提出コンテンツ　要チェック
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.67,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Tick tock tick tock
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.67,0:22:41.76,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}前　前ならえ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:43.17,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Yah　ついていくしかないじゃん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.17,0:22:44.05,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}グルチャのテンポ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.05,0:22:45.64,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}欠けていた情熱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.64,0:22:47.35,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}上がってくモチベ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:48.60,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Don’t stop, pop, pop
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:50.81,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}We’re going up, up, up higher
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.81,0:22:53.06,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}暗闇の中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:54.56,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}無音で drive
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.56,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}孤独な傷跡が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:23:00.57,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}名前を呼ぶ声に今
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:03.07,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}満たされ癒えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:04.11,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}始まったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:06.32,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}駆け出す未来は今
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:08.20,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}狙い定めた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:09.62,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Because I’m a winner
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:13.00,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}迷うたびに笑い飛ばしていけ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:14.91,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}外さない弾道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:16.42,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Because I’m a winner
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:18.21,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}この弾丸は fire fire
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:18.21,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur1\fscx60\fscy60\pos(916,0)}たま
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.21,0:23:19.67,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Breaking the chains
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.67,0:23:23.13,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}夢はもうNever ever　捨てない promise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:25.09,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}I will never give up, give up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:26.97,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Give up, give up
